Thank you.

01:25:44.520 --> 01:25:45.560
- Wash your hands.

01:26:05.440 --> 01:26:12.460
- Jim, go back.

01:26:12.460 --> 01:26:16.490
Let's just pack up, sell the house, and go back.

01:26:16.490 --> 01:26:18.780
- Are you serious?

01:26:18.780 --> 01:26:21.340
- I have never been more serious in my whole life.

01:26:21.340 --> 01:26:23.420
I don't think I've relaxed for five minutes

01:26:23.420 --> 01:26:26.160
since we moved out here.

01:26:26.160 --> 01:26:28.400
You were right, it was my fault.

01:26:28.400 --> 01:26:30.000
Pushed, and I pulled at you,

01:26:30.160 --> 01:26:35.730
every single direction until you had no choice but to give in and i wouldn't let myself see what

01:26:35.730 --> 01:26:42.870
it was doing to you all this work and the pressure no wonder you had to bury yourself in that lawn

01:26:42.870 --> 01:26:52.650
i'm sorry i made fun of it you worked so hard and you did such a good job lester says it's

01:26:52.650 --> 01:26:59.880
the best looking lawn on the block it is and you think that you did all that while you were working

01:27:00.640 --> 01:27:05.180
And here I picked on you, and I criticized you, and I yelled at you in front of the kids.

01:27:05.500 --> 01:27:06.440
I yelled at you, too.

01:27:07.110 --> 01:27:08.850
Not as loud as I yelled at you.

01:27:11.790 --> 01:27:14.260
Let's go back.

01:27:15.190 --> 01:27:17.490
What about your space? You don't want to give up all your writing.

01:27:17.710 --> 01:27:18.930
Space? What space?

01:27:19.280 --> 01:27:24.330
You were right about that, too. If I had any talent at all, if I had anything on the ball, I could have written anywhere.

01:27:26.660 --> 01:27:27.610
I want to give it up.

01:27:29.200 --> 01:27:30.000
I'm giving it up.

01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:41.180
up it's given up sure about something i feel better already ah maybe someday when that when

01:27:41.180 --> 01:27:46.060
the kids are grown and we're filthy rich i'll give it a whirl again but right now i have enough to

01:27:46.060 --> 01:27:50.460
keep me busy what about the kids are going back to the kids they adjust so easily and they'll have

01:27:50.460 --> 01:27:54.380
all their old friends again they won't have the same car won't be able to get that kind of look

01:27:54.380 --> 01:27:57.210
around there are other apartments

01:28:00.260 --> 01:28:03.360
I am just so sorry I've put you through all this.

01:28:07.930 --> 01:28:10.020
There's something, you know that?

01:28:10.670 --> 01:28:11.200
Yeah.

01:28:16.390 --> 01:28:18.290
Sensational new lawn clipper today.

01:28:29.020 --> 01:28:29.540
Automatic.

01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:31.160
have to do is take a cut.

01:28:31.460 --> 01:28:32.660
I got to do some.

01:28:33.430 --> 01:28:48.930
Staple with matching staples.

01:28:49.190 --> 01:28:51.290
A pen holder with pen.

01:28:51.640 --> 01:28:59.090
A pad with a funny saying on it.

01:29:00.120 --> 01:29:11.710
picture the kids in me of course if you do want to quit we we can take it apart but you don't want

01:29:11.710 --> 01:29:20.620
to write you could always come out here and then and just doodle or you could tap dance you could

01:29:20.620 --> 01:29:29.450
look at the car or you could even scream when did you do all this

01:29:30.160 --> 01:29:30.460
Today.

01:29:30.810 --> 01:29:32.830
Today, Lester and I hit every shop on the mall.

01:29:32.950 --> 01:29:34.970
The old kid can still move when he has to.

01:29:35.110 --> 01:29:36.050
But the family.

01:29:36.310 --> 01:29:37.130
Oh, that was a snap.

01:29:37.960 --> 01:29:38.940
What, didn't you go to work?

01:29:39.470 --> 01:29:40.960
I left as soon as I got there.

01:29:40.980 --> 01:29:41.720
They don't own me.

01:29:42.520 --> 01:29:56.100
We lost that chocolate cereal account.

01:29:56.240 --> 01:29:56.600
Honey.

01:29:56.740 --> 01:29:59.050
Hold on, I hated that damn product anyway.

01:29:59.210 --> 01:30:00.000
My last suggestion.

01:30:00.540 --> 01:30:02.240
Serial can give you pimples.

01:30:03.700 --> 01:30:05.200
Hey, take care for it.

01:30:07.870 --> 01:30:12.340
Honey, I think sometimes I'm the last guy in the world to give something.

01:30:12.500 --> 01:30:12.680
What?

01:30:14.280 --> 01:30:17.540
I've really been selfish and stupid about this.

01:30:17.900 --> 01:30:19.500
I know I haven't backed you.

01:30:19.720 --> 01:30:25.820
And you're the most important person in the world to me.

01:30:25.940 --> 01:30:30.000
And I would really hate to see you quit before you start.

01:30:47.280 --> 01:30:50.440
You know, I haven't been this happy since the doctor told me the rabbit lived.

01:30:52.160 --> 01:30:58.010
I'm here to see you.

01:31:00.960 --> 01:31:04.000
Frank Loring in County, Building Inspector Sewage and Drainage.

01:31:04.850 --> 01:31:06.790
I'm afraid you've got the wrong septic tank out there.

01:31:07.480 --> 01:31:08.980
I didn't know I had a choice.

01:31:09.760 --> 01:31:10.800
Actually, you don't.

01:31:11.530 --> 01:31:13.910
You see, according to this, you've got a 621B.

01:31:14.660 --> 01:31:16.840
Now, that's not up to code, and we'll have to change it.

01:31:17.480 --> 01:31:18.060
Change it?

01:31:18.320 --> 01:31:18.720
Yes.

01:31:19.390 --> 01:31:23.410
We'll have a man out here dig up your lawn first thing in the morning, okay?

01:31:24.210 --> 01:31:25.650
Have a nice day.

01:31:25.830 --> 01:31:26.270
Excuse me.

01:31:27.820 --> 01:31:28.200
Wait a minute.

01:31:28.200 --> 01:31:28.990
Hold on a minute.

01:31:29.070 --> 01:31:29.750
Wait a minute.

01:31:29.750 --> 01:31:30.000
Wait a minute.

01:31:30.350 --> 01:31:31.670
dig up our lawn, can they?

01:31:34.260 --> 01:31:35.680
I spent an hour this morning

01:31:35.680 --> 01:31:38.060
Take it easy, nobody's gonna come in here

01:31:38.060 --> 01:31:39.680
make an announcement like that

01:31:39.680 --> 01:31:40.880
and walk out of here

01:31:40.880 --> 01:31:43.160
I would take this to court if I had to

01:31:43.160 --> 01:31:46.040
Nobody's gonna come here and dig up this lawn

01:32:31.440 --> 01:32:48.340
Benson, I could have sworn that septic tank was in the front yard.
